START
Read array
Copy array into three separate arrays

SELECTION SORT:
FOR i = 0 to n-2
    Find minimum element
    Swap minimum with array[i]
    Count comparisons and swaps
END FOR

BUBBLE SORT:
FOR i = 0 to n-2
    Compare adjacent elements
    Swap if they are in wrong order
    Count comparisons and swaps
END FOR

INSERTION SORT:
FOR i = 1 to n-1
    Store current element as key
    Shift larger elements to right
    Insert key in correct position
    Count comparisons and movements
END FOR

Display sorted arrays and operation counts
STOP
